#: ../../source/docs/common-jsn-sr04t.rst:3 d60deec337b7421da5cf8bc3b54cda67
msgid "Waterproof JSN-SR04T Ultrasonic Distance Sensor"
msgstr "防水 JSN-SR04T 超声波距离传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jsn-sr04t.rst:5 f42a28da972c43108a27ad07ea927a08
msgid ""
"The JSN-SR04T is an ultrasonic distance sensor. There are two versions v2.0 "
"and v3.0. They differ in the range of action. v2.0 with a range of 25 to 450"
" cm. v3.0 with a range of 20 to 600 cm. Also more stable. The very short "
"range makes it of limited use."
msgstr ""
"JSN-SR04T 是一款超声波距离传感器，有 v2.0 和 v3.0 两个版本，区别在于测量范围。v2.0 测量范围 25~450 cm，v3.0 "
"测量范围 20~600 cm，稳定性更强。极短的测量范围限制了其应用场景。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jsn-sr04t.rst:17 74ecad20ba8d41159586bad89c34850e
msgid "Connection to the autopilot"
msgstr "连接飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jsn-sr04t.rst:19 7975bd920ebc4234ba683227d629b0f7
msgid "To setup as the first rangefinder. Reboot after setting parameters:"
msgstr "设置为第一个测距仪，设置参数后重启："

#: ../../source/docs/common-jsn-sr04t.rst:21 32260a289a32471baca558edadf62128
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX<RNGFND1_MAX>` = \"4.5\" (i.e. 4.5m max range for v2.0 ver)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX<RNGFND1_MAX>` = 「4.5」（即 v2.0 版本最大量程 4.5m）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jsn-sr04t.rst:22 6105b4f3b5464f8b9ac0e309fdd5252d
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN<RNGFND1_MIN>` = \"0.25\" (i.e. 0.25m min range for v2.0 "
"ver)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_MIN<RNGFND1_MIN>` = 「0.25」（即 v2.0 版本最小量程 0.25m）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jsn-sr04t.rst:23 f1afa09c48194ea4b7fee2fae8ef0b83
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_STOP_PIN<RNGFND1_STOP_PIN>` = Enter GPIO number for pin "
"attached to JSN-SR04T \"Trigger\" pin. See :ref:`common-gpios`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_STOP_PIN<RNGFND1_STOP_PIN>` = 输入连接到 JSN-SR04T 「Trigger」引脚的 "
"GPIO 编号。参见 :ref:`common-gpios`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jsn-sr04t.rst:24 6a001053cbcf4c40afc536287a24c662
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_PIN<RNGFND1_PIN>` = Enter GPIO number for pin attached to JSN-"
"SR04T \"Echo\" pin."
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_PIN<RNGFND1_PIN>` = 输入连接到 JSN-SR04T 「Echo」引脚的 GPIO 编号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jsn-sr04t.rst:25 88b142945ed944ff836b020adb863eaf
msgid ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE<RNGFND1_TYPE>` = “30\" (HC-SR04 sonar)"
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_TYPE<RNGFND1_TYPE>` = 「30」（HC-SR04 声呐）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jsn-sr04t.rst:26 c2fa5712948045aab9fc6369b413cf63
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_ORIENT<RNGFND1_ORIENT>` = \"25\" (Downward facing) if used for"
" altitude control."
msgstr ":ref:`RNGFND1_ORIENT<RNGFND1_ORIENT>` = 「25」（朝下安装），如果用于高度控制。"
